1059
00:37:48,504 --> 00:37:49,472
THANK YOU.

1060
00:37:52,208 --> 00:37:54,243
CHEER UP. GO AHEAD.

1061
00:37:54,243 --> 00:37:55,712
LOOKIN' ALL SAD.

1062
00:37:56,779 --> 00:37:58,181
COME ON. COME ON.
