1063
00:38:00,416 --> 00:38:01,918
OH, GIRL,
YOU GOTTA STOP.

1064
00:38:13,896 --> 00:38:15,298
CAN YOU GUYS
STAND IN FRONT OF ME?

1065
00:38:15,298 --> 00:38:16,499
I JUST WANT TO SAY
