1066
00:38:18,267 --> 00:38:21,371
REBECCA, I ADMIRE YOUR EMOTION
RIGHT NOW.

1067
00:38:21,371 --> 00:38:22,538
IT SHOWS TO ME THAT
THIS WAS SOMETHING

1068
00:38:22,538 --> 00:38:24,307
THAT'S VERY IMPORTANT TO YOU.

1069
00:38:26,409 --> 00:38:29,612
TIFFANY, I'M EXTREMELY
DISAPPOINTED IN YOU.

1070
00:38:29,612 --> 00:38:30,880
THIS IS A JOKE TO YOU.

1071
00:38:30,880 --> 00:38:32,215
YOU'VE BEEN
THROUGH ANGER MANAGEMENT,

1072
00:38:32,215 --> 00:38:33,583
YOU'VE BEEN THROUGH
YOUR GRANDMOTHER

1073
00:38:33,583 --> 00:38:35,485
GETTING HER LIGHTS TURNED OFF
TO BUY YOU A SWIMSUIT

1074
00:38:35,485 --> 00:38:37,220
FOR THIS COMPETITION,
AND YOU GO OVER THERE

1075
00:38:37,220 --> 00:38:39,355
AND YOU JOKE AND YOU LAUGH.

1076
00:38:39,355 --> 00:38:41,290
THIS IS SERIOUS TO THESE GIRLS,
AND THIS SHOULD BE

1077
00:38:41,290 --> 00:38:42,291
SERIOUS TO YOU.

1078
00:38:42,291 --> 00:38:43,359
LOOKS CAN BE DECEIVING.

1079
00:38:43,359 --> 00:38:45,695
I'M HURT. I AM.

1080
00:38:45,695 --> 00:38:48,398
BUT I CAN'T CHANGE IT, TYRA.

1081
00:38:48,398 --> 00:38:49,732
I'VE BEEN--

1082
00:38:49,732 --> 00:38:50,933
YES, YOU CAN.

1083
00:38:50,933 --> 00:38:53,403
YOU CAN'T CHANGE WHAT?
I'M SICK OF CRYING ABOUT

1084
00:38:53,403 --> 00:38:55,338
STUFF THAT I CANNOT CHANGE.

1085
00:38:55,338 --> 00:38:56,506
I'M SICK OF
BEING DISAPPOINTED.

1086
00:38:56,506 --> 00:38:58,374
I'M SICK OF ALL OF IT. I'M NOT--

1087
00:38:58,374 --> 00:38:59,609
YOU AIN'T SICK
OF BEING DISAPPOINTED.

1088
00:38:59,609 --> 00:39:01,411
OBVIOUSLY I AM.
NO, YOU'RE NOT.

1089
00:39:01,411 --> 00:39:03,279
IF YOU WERE SICK OF
BEING DISAPPOINTED,

1090
00:39:03,279 --> 00:39:04,680
YOU WOULD STAND UP
AND YOU WOULD TAKE CONTROL

1091
00:39:04,680 --> 00:39:05,948
OF YOUR DESTINY.

1092
00:39:05,948 --> 00:39:08,451
DO YOU KNOW THAT YOU HAD
A POSSIBILITY TO WIN?

1093
00:39:08,451 --> 00:39:10,486
DO YOU KNOW THAT ALL OF AMERICA
IS ROOTING FOR YOU?

1094
00:39:10,486 --> 00:39:12,288
DO YOU KNOW THAT?

1095
00:39:12,288 --> 00:39:13,689
AND THEN YOU COME IN HERE
AND YOU TREAT THIS LIKE A JOKE.

1096
00:39:13,689 --> 00:39:14,557
YOU COME IN HERE
AND LOOK AT THAT AND SAY,

1097
00:39:14,557 --> 00:39:16,426
"I CAN'T READ THAT."

1098
00:39:16,426 --> 00:39:18,728
YOU READ TEN TIMES BETTER THAN
HALF OF THOSE GIRLS OVER THERE.

1099
00:39:18,728 --> 00:39:20,196
YOU DID.
YOU DID.

1100
00:39:20,196 --> 00:39:21,798
AND YOU COME IN HERE
WITH A DEFEATIST ATTITUDE.

1101
00:39:21,798 --> 00:39:24,700
I DON'T HAVE A BAD ATTITUDE.
MAYBE I AM ANGRY INSIDE.

1102
00:39:24,700 --> 00:39:26,436
I'VE BEEN THROUGH STUFF,
SO I'M ANGRY.

1103
00:39:26,436 --> 00:39:27,737
YES, BUT THIS IS NOT--

1104
00:39:27,737 --> 00:39:29,238
BE QUIET, TIFFANY.

1105
00:39:29,238 --> 00:39:30,440
BE QUIET!

1106
00:39:30,440 --> 00:39:31,474
WHAT IS WRONG WITH YOU?

1107
00:39:31,474 --> 00:39:32,875
STOP IT!

1108
00:39:35,211 --> 00:39:36,846
I HAVE NEVER IN MY LIFE
YELLED AT A GIRL LIKE THIS!

1109
00:39:38,748 --> 00:39:41,484
WHEN MY MOTHER YELLS LIKE THIS,
IT'S BECAUSE SHE LOVES ME!

1110
00:39:41,484 --> 00:39:42,618
I WAS ROOTING FOR YOU!

1111
00:39:42,618 --> 00:39:43,686
WE WERE ALL
ROOTING FOR YOU!

1112
00:39:43,686 --> 00:39:45,321
HOW DARE YOU?!

1113
00:39:45,321 --> 00:39:47,523
LEARN SOMETHING FROM THIS!

1114
00:39:47,523 --> 00:39:48,925
WHEN YOU GO TO BED AT NIGHT,
YOU LAY THERE AND YOU TAKE

1115
00:39:48,925 --> 00:39:51,360
RESPONSIBILITY FOR YOURSELF!

1116
00:39:51,360 --> 00:39:54,330
'CAUSE NOBODY'S GONNA TAKE
RESPONSIBILITY FOR YOU.

1117
00:39:54,330 --> 00:39:55,665
YOU ROLLIN' YOUR EYES,
AND YOU ACT LIKE THIS 'CAUSE

1118
00:39:55,665 --> 00:39:56,899
YOU'VE HEARD IT ALL BEFORE.

1119
00:39:56,899 --> 00:39:58,267
YOU'VE HEARD IT
ALL BEFORE.

1120
00:39:58,267 --> 00:39:59,569
YOU DON'T KNOW
WHERE THE HELL I COME FROM.

1121
00:39:59,569 --> 00:40:01,471
YOU HAVE NO IDEA WHAT
I'VE BEEN THROUGH.

1122
00:40:01,471 --> 00:40:02,772
BUT I'M NOT A VICTIM.

1123
00:40:02,772 --> 00:40:04,941
I GROW FROM IT
AND I LEARN.

1124
00:40:04,941 --> 00:40:06,809
TAKE RESPONSIBILITY
FOR YOURSELF.

1125
00:40:17,620 --> 00:40:19,922
I'VE NEVER SEEN TYRA
THAT WAY EVER.

1126
00:40:19,922 --> 00:40:21,891
I CAN'T EVEN IMAGINE HER
BEING THAT WAY.

1127
00:40:21,891 --> 00:40:23,626
BUT SHE'S ANGRY
BECAUSE SHE THINKS

1128
00:40:23,626 --> 00:40:26,195
TIFFANY HASN'T CHANGED AND THAT
SHE TAKES THIS AS A JOKE

1129
00:40:26,195 --> 00:40:27,964
AND THAT EVERYONE WANTS IT
SO BAD FOR HER,

1130
00:40:27,964 --> 00:40:29,565
BUT SHE DOESN'T EVEN WANT IT
FOR HERSELF.

1131
00:40:29,565 --> 00:40:31,234
I'M NOT FENNA BREAK DOWN
FOR YOU AND NOBODY ELSE.

1132
00:40:31,234 --> 00:40:33,202
YOU AIN'T DID... FOR ME
BUT BRING ME HERE

1133
00:40:33,202 --> 00:40:35,271
AND PUT ME THROUGH HELL
THESE WEEKS.

1134
00:40:36,772 --> 00:40:38,674
I THINK TYRA MIGHT
BE REALLY RIGHT ABOUT THAT.

1135
00:40:40,543 --> 00:40:41,677
TYRA.

1136
00:40:44,247 --> 00:40:45,348
SHE WAS RIGHT.

1137
00:40:45,348 --> 00:40:46,816
THE ONLY THING
THAT'S KEEPING ME HERE

1138
00:40:46,816 --> 00:40:48,718
WAS MY GRANDMA AND MY CHILD.

1139
00:40:48,718 --> 00:40:50,786
AND I TRIED TO HANG IN THERE
FOR MY GRANDMA.

1140
00:40:50,786 --> 00:40:52,688
MY GRANDMA JUST WANTS
THE BEST FOR ME.

1141
00:40:54,690 --> 00:40:56,792
I'M REALLY DISAPPOINTED
RIGHT NOW.

1142
00:40:56,792 --> 00:40:58,761
BUT NOT EVERYONE CAN SAY
THEY'VE DONE THIS,

1143
00:40:58,761 --> 00:41:02,498
AND I CAN PUT THAT CHECK MARK
NEXT TO IT.

1144
00:41:03,900 --> 00:41:06,202
I'M WALKING AWAY HERE
KNOWING A LOT MORE

1145
00:41:06,202 --> 00:41:07,970
ABOUT THE BUSINESS
AND ESPECIALLY ABOUT MYSELF

1146
00:41:07,970 --> 00:41:09,605
AND WHAT MY PRIORITIES ARE.

1147
00:41:09,605 --> 00:41:12,842
FAMILY IS NUMBER ONE.

1148
00:41:12,842 --> 00:41:16,345
I'M GOING HOME TO GET MARRIED,
AND WE'LL TAKE IT FROM THERE.

1149
00:41:16,345 --> 00:41:17,547
PART OF ME DID GIVE UP.

1150
00:41:17,547 --> 00:41:20,583
I WAS BEING VERY DISRESPECTFUL.

1151
00:41:20,583 --> 00:41:22,618
BUT I'M TAKING
A LOT HOME WITH ME.

1152
00:41:22,618 --> 00:41:24,253
TYRA REALLY DID CARE ABOUT ME--

1153
00:41:24,253 --> 00:41:25,688
HER YELLING AT ME.

1154
00:41:25,688 --> 00:41:27,924
I HAVE THE UTMOST RESPECT
FOR HER 'CAUSE SHE COULD HAVE

1155
00:41:27,924 --> 00:41:29,525
EASILY SAID, "OKAY, WHATEVER"

1156
00:41:29,525 --> 00:41:31,194
AND, YOU KNOW, "BYE."

1157
00:41:31,194 --> 00:41:33,596
THAT SHOWED ME
THAT SHE SAW DEEPLY INTO ME

1158
00:41:33,596 --> 00:41:35,565
AND SHE CARED ABOUT ME.

1159
00:41:35,565 --> 00:41:38,668
AND THAT'S COOL KNOWING THAT,
YOU KNOW, TYRA CARES ABOUT YOU.

1160
00:41:38,668 --> 00:41:41,737
I'M GOING TO GO BACK HOME
AND HAVE A GOOD LIFE NOW

1161
00:41:41,737 --> 00:41:42,972
AND BE THE BEST TIFFANY
I CAN BE.

1162
00:41:55,318 --> 00:41:57,386
STAYED TUNED FOR SCENES
FROM OUR NEXT EPISODE.

1163
00:42:00,223 --> 00:42:02,391
COMING UP ON
"AMERICA'S NEXT TOP MODEL"...

1164
00:42:02,391 --> 00:42:04,727
SHOCK WAVES FROM JUDGING
PUT THE GIRLS ON EDGE.

1165
00:42:04,727 --> 00:42:06,762
THEY ELIMINATED BOTH OF THEM.

1166
00:42:06,762 --> 00:42:08,664
IT JUST SHOWS YOU
THAT IT'S ANYONE'S GAME.

1167
00:42:08,664 --> 00:42:10,600
THE MODELS GET A TASTE
OF THE SPOTLIGHT.

1168
00:42:10,600 --> 00:42:13,536
ANYONE IN THE HOUSE YOU EVER
WANTED TO JUST STRANGLE?

1169
00:42:13,536 --> 00:42:16,806
BUT A CELEBRITY GUEST LEAVES
THEM AT A LOSS FOR WORDS.

1170
00:42:16,806 --> 00:42:18,374
OH, MY GOD.

1171
00:42:18,374 --> 00:42:21,544
AND A PERSONAL TRAGEDY
SHATTERS KAHLEN'S FOCUS.

1172
00:42:21,544 --> 00:42:23,579
MY MIND JUST IS BLANK.

1173
00:42:23,579 --> 00:42:25,381
SHE'S A GREAT GIRL,
AND I DON'T WANNA SEE HER GO

1174
00:42:25,381 --> 00:42:27,250
HOME OVER SOMETHING LIKE THIS.

1175
00:42:32,955 --> 00:42:34,624
